 "remarks": "Great location downtown for a well-maintained two bedroom, 2 bath unit. Open floor plan allows easy access to dining area, kitchen and in-unit laundry. Two oversized bedrooms with ample closet/storage space. Primary bedroom is an ensuite with it's own bath and also provides additional access to the covered deck. Hardwood floors, granite countertops in kitchen, nicely painted and well-maintained. Central air, hot air heat. Parking in garage underneath as well as below grade. Across from Scalzi Park, close to shopping, restaurants and nightlife. One mile to Metro North and I95 access. Additional amenities include a gym with a sauna and seperate shower areas.",
